exports[`the database backup page's markup is unchanged > a deployment that offers no in-app restore 1`] = `"<div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthXl css-hhdjsd-MuiContainer-root"><div class="MuiBox-root css-8f57v9"><h1 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1it4a80-MuiTypography-root">Database Backup</h1><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-1xz17g7-MuiTypography-root">Schedule backups, review what has been taken, and restore the database from one.</p><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation0 MuiAlert-root MuiAlert-colorInfo MuiAlert-standard css-26377s-MuiPaper-root-MuiAlert-root" role="alert" data-testid="db-backup-restore-disabled" style="--Paper-shadow: none;"><div class="MuiAlert-icon css-vab54s-MuiAlert-icon"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeInherit css-1ckov0h-MuiSvgIcon-root" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="InfoOutlinedIcon"><path d="M11,9H13V7H11M12,20C7.59,20 4,16.41 4,12C4,7.59 7.59,4 12,4C16.41,4 20,7.59 20, 12C20,16.41 16.41,20 12,20M12,2A10,10 0 0,0 2,12A10,10 0 0,0 12,22A10,10 0 0,0 22,12A10, 10 0 0,0 12,2M11,17H13V11H11V17Z"></path></svg></div><div class="MuiAlert-message css-zioonp-MuiAlert-message">In-app restore is disabled in SaaS mode. Use your database provider's point-in-time recovery. The procedure is in this repository at <span class="MuiBox-root css-1ycwou0">docs/runbooks/database-restore.md</span>.</div></div><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 css-mo54xu-MuiPaper-root" style="--Paper-shadow: 0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"><h6 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h6 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1wmifpn-MuiTypography-root">Schedule and retention</h6><form class="MuiBox-root css-0" novalidate=""><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEn